# A tool name kiln never registered: an error block naming the tool as
# unknown (internal/harness/turn.go beginTool checks registration before
# the active tool set, so this is not reported as a restriction).
@faux testdata/faux/qa/tools-unknown.yaml
@args --permission-mode dontAsk

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE call a tool that does not exist
KEY enter
WAITFOR /That tool doesn't exist/ 20
SHOT unknown-tool
EXPECT /unknown tool "frobnicate"/
EXPECT_NOT /not in the active tool set/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
